    "details": "<p><strong>Startup Street XI</strong> is a 24-hour entrepreneurial marathon that takes participants through the startup journey &mdash; from <strong>ideation and market validation to business planning and pitching</strong>. With expert mentors, industry speakers, networking opportunities, and a Shark Tank-style final pitch, participants get hands-on exposure to real-world entrepreneurship.</p>\n<p><strong>Event Timeline:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Day 1 &ndash; Kickoff &amp; Ideation</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>5:00 PM &ndash; 6:00 PM: Registration &amp; Check-in</li>\n<li>6:00 PM &ndash; 6:30 PM: Opening Ceremony &amp; Briefing</li>\n<li>6:30 PM &ndash; 7:30 PM: Speaker Session &amp; Q&amp;A</li>\n<li>7:30 PM &ndash; 8:00 PM: Team Formation &amp; Networking</li>\n<li>8:00 PM &ndash; 10:00 PM: Ideation &amp; Problem Validation</li>\n<li>10:00 PM &ndash; 11:00 PM: Mentor Checkpoint</li>\n<li>11:00 PM &ndash; 12:00 AM: Engagement Activities</li>\n<li>12:00 AM &ndash; 8:00 AM: Overnight Preparation</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Day 2 &ndash; Review &amp; Pitching</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>8:30 AM &ndash; 9:30 AM: Review Round 1</li>\n<li>9:30 AM &ndash; 10:30 AM: Speaker Session &amp; Q&amp;A</li>\n<li>10:45 AM &ndash; 11:00 AM: Elimination Round</li>\n<li>11:15 AM &ndash; 1:00 PM: Pitching Round 1</li>\n<li>1:00 PM &ndash; 2:00 PM: Lunch &amp; Networking</li>\n<li>2:00 PM &ndash; 4:00 PM: Final Pitching Round</li>\n<li>4:00 PM &ndash; 4:30 PM: Valedictory &amp; Prize Distribution</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Key Highlights:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>24-hour overnight entrepreneurial challenge</li>\n<li>Mentorship from industry experts</li>\n<li>Market research and business model development</li>\n<li>Networking and speaker sessions</li>\n<li>Shark Tank-style pitching</li>\n<li>Opportunity to transform ideas into actionable ventures</li>\n</ul>",
